    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Marwao mazima gha Wakohani",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Jija ijoho jerwalwa naighu ya naivera, suti jose jikaie ja uzi wa buluu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Singonyi kwaro kuchabonya mishono kwa uzi ulukilo, eri isecherashuka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kungire ndembe ra mkomamanga hemunyi kwaro, ra buluu, zambarau, na ra uzi wa ngundu; njugha ra dhahabu rikikaia ghadi na ghadi ya iro ndembe; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "njugha ya dhahabu na ndembe ya mkomamanga, njugha ya dhahabu na ndembe mkomamanga andenyi ya hemu ya ijo ijoho kujimara chia rose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haruni uchakaia ukirwa ijo ijoho ngelo engia kwa wudumiki. Hata iji wakangia aja Andu kwa Wueli imbiri kwapo, na ngelo wakafuma, iro njugha richakaia rikisikirika, eri usechefwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kubonye kibau cha dhahabu ielie, nao kuchikote mbari ra dhahabu sa muhuri riandikilo ‘MWELI KWA BWANA.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao kuchifunge na imbiri ya kiremba kwa kamba ya buluu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haruni uchakaia ukichirwa icho kibau chamunyi kwake, upate kudwa wuwiwi ghwa wandu; eri Ini BWANA nipate kughirumiria mafunyo ghose gha wueli nichaafunyirwa ni Waisraeli, hata ngera wabonyere kaung'a ngelo efunya agho mafunyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.38"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kuluke ijoho ja Haruni jitolelo kwa kitani ndicha, sena kubonye kiremba cha kitani ndicha, na kamba yaro itolelo nicha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.39"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kuwibonyere wana wa Haruni majoho, mishipi, na kofia, wipate kukaia na wubaa, na kughoka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kumrushe mwanyinyu Haruni na wana wake agho marwao, nao kuwidunge mavuda na kuwiwika wakfu kwa wundu ghwa wudumiki ghwa wukohani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sena kuwibonyere weke mwadeghu wa kitani ndicha, kufuma kiwonunyi hata barenyi; wipate kufinikira wuduu ghwawo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Suti Haruni na wana wake wiro awo weke mwadeghu iji wakangia Hema Ekwania, angu madhabahunyi, wikinidumikia andenyi ya aho Andu kwa Wueli; eri wisechebwaghwa kwa kughuwonyera wuduu ghwawo. Iji ni ilaghiro ja toe kwa Haruni na wana wake.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.43"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
